      "suggested_lean_module": "RequestProject.Gap.Tests.Testbugfix.20180130TrivAffSpace",
      "code_lines": 6,
      "definitions": 0,
      "effort_person_days": 0.06,
      "header_quote": "Verify that enumerating \"extended\" vectors\" over a trivial vector space\nworks as intended (this used to fail, because testing whether the empty\nlist [] is contained in the vector space V defined below, which is\ncollection, by definition always fails in GAP, even though [] is e.g. equal\nto Zero(V). This is a major problem by itself, but difficult to resolve.\n\nIn any case, we sidestep this larger issue, and just worry about the\nparticular case of \"extended\" vectors."
    },
    {
      "path": "tst/testbugfix/2018-03-21-IsFinitelyGeneratedGroup.tst",
      "language": "tst",
